    "innovation": "This paper synthesizes multiple datasets to argue that significant austral spring warming in West Antarctica is driven by atmospheric circulation changes (Pacific South American modes) forced by Rossby wave-trains originating from increasing sea surface temperatures in the tropical and subtropical Pacific.",
