            "paragraph": "The SAM trend has greatly influenced temperature trends in East Antarctica (Marshall 2007). On the Peninsula, the SAM trend appears to have played a key role in the summer warming on the eastern side, but a limited role in the strong winter warming on the western side (Roscoe et al. 2006; Marshall 2007).",
